# The thumb with Fingers tracked: an empty hand held ahead at chest height, its fingers forward and its thumb up, seen
# from the palm's side, the back of the hand and above, the player's thumb off the controller and on it. The right hand
# open (its grip would bring the wrench out); the left open and in a fist; then both raised before the eyes, turned each
# way. Shots are named hand-state-view; look at them: 0.1.14 turned the thumb back toward the wrist and its old views,
